  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMS International Media Support 2020-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">independent media produce and distribute reliable and relevant information that contributes to free expression as well as peaceful and democratic development, with the following outcomes: (1)  Enhanced safety of journalists; (2) enhancing access to information and strengthening of independent media; (3) rapid response interventions in support of local media actors affected by crises or conflict; (4) gender-sensitive and evidence-based strategic and organisational development; (5) disinformation on freedom of religion or believe is countered and voices relevantly represented and covered through public-interest content; (6) The public in the MENA region has access to a wider range of news, information, and analysis reflecting a plurality of views and it can claim and exercise its right to freedom of expression more fully.</narrative>
  </description>
